    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/e8647b11c1b7ff6bade84d1680e0dfb1.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/e8647b11c1b7ff6bade84d1680e0dfb1.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Touko In Underland is an exploratory horror game with a focus on beautiful and atmospheric environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the loop in a seemingly endless labyrinth that has trapped Touko with her unhinged stalker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/68d055d96a1c0c9743da1b1e8e83b1e1.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/68d055d96a1c0c9743da1b1e8e83b1e1.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/1d4e8721b7f45829d1bdf50763c1c002.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" width=365 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/1d4e8721b7f45829d1bdf50763c1c002.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Touko escape the world of Underland while avoiding the stalker who is always waiting in the shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/21d7da3381304eadca73f2706adc5b27.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/21d7da3381304eadca73f2706adc5b27.apng?t=1750342390\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=350 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Copyable and highlightable text of game features below)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features include </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supernatural mazes and labyrinths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive soundscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Riddles and interactive set pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reactive gameplay to the horrors that stalk you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interesting locations and interactions with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horrors lurking in every corner.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/e8647b11c1b7ff6bade84d1680e0dfb1.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/e8647b11c1b7ff6bade84d1680e0dfb1.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Touko In Underland is an exploratory horror game with a focus on beautiful and atmospheric environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the loop in a seemingly endless labyrinth that has trapped Touko with her unhinged stalker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/68d055d96a1c0c9743da1b1e8e83b1e1.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/68d055d96a1c0c9743da1b1e8e83b1e1.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/1d4e8721b7f45829d1bdf50763c1c002.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" width=365 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/1d4e8721b7f45829d1bdf50763c1c002.webm?t=1750342390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Touko escape the world of Underland while avoiding the stalker who is always waiting in the shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/21d7da3381304eadca73f2706adc5b27.poster.avif?t=1750342390\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140420/extras/21d7da3381304eadca73f2706adc5b27.apng?t=1750342390\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=350 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Copyable and highlightable text of game features below)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features include </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supernatural mazes and labyrinths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive soundscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Riddles and interactive set pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reactive gameplay to the horrors that stalk you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interesting locations and interactions with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horrors lurking in every corner.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Spirited away to a strange looping world, Touko must solve the puzzles that block her route to escape. Unfortunately, an unhinged stalker follows in the shadows of Underland...",
